{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202695PHuk9n521795661740.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>韓國中央銀行今年第三次加息，上調基準利率四分之一厘，升至3.25厘的兩年高位。</p><p></p><p>繼今年七月及八月加息以後，韓國中央銀行在今年最後一次議息會議再宣布加息，把基準利率由3厘升至3.25厘，主要基於物價升勢尚未受抑制，而以半導體為中心的強勁出口，令經濟增長超出預期。</p><p></p><p>韓國第三季度國內生產總值按年增長百分之3.4，好過市場預期，令韓國中央銀行有空間加息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:00:05.400709+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:57:10.832421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:53:28.955790+00:00","content_hash":"647522b1ce131083e2c40590c87f4421532845195ead036ba0c3e87dcbcf0b3c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:00:05.400709+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}